  "description": "After being scammed by a schoolmate, Oh Min-Jae is forced into a scam himself when he is tasked with pretending to be Kwon Il-Hyeop’s first love in exchange for clearing his sudden debt. Despite Il-Hyeop’s claims, Min-Jae is certain he can’t be the rich boy’s actual first love. And yet, their first encounter has Min-Jae immediately drawn to Il-Hyeop like an animal in heat. Just what is going on? And what beastly secret could Il-Hyeop be hiding?\n\n(Source: Tappytoon)",
